ESP32-S3R8 BASED DESIGN (AVOID STRAPPING PINS IO0, IO3, IO45, IO46 AT ALL COSTS):
GPIOs 26 TO 32 USED FOR EXTERNAL FLASH MEMORY Winbond W25Q128JVSIQ
GPIOs 33 TO 37 USED BY INTERNAL PSRAM -> LEFT UNCONNECTED
GPIOs 22 TO 25 DON'T EXIST ON THE ESP32-S3

ILI9341 SCREEN:
CS IO18 PULLED HIGH WITH 10K
RST GPA2
DC IO17
MOSI MOSIB
SCK SCKB
LED IO11 TRANSISTOR DRIVER IN SCREEN SHIELD
MISO MISOB WITH SOLDER JUMPER IN CASE OF CONTENTION WITH SD CARD

TOUCH CONTROLLER:
CLK SCKA
CS IO6 PULLED HIGH WITH 10K
DIN MOSIA
DO MISOA
IRQ GPB4

SD CARD:
DAT2 10KOHM TO 3V3
DAT3/CD SPICLK_N/IO48 PULLED-UP TO 3V3 VIA 10KOHM
CMD MOSIB
CLK SCKB
VSS GND
DAT0 MISOB PULLED-UP TO 3V3 VIA 10KOHM
DAT1 10KOHM TO 3V3
DET GPB6

EXTERNAL HEADER FOR I2C PERIPHERALS (SCL, SDA):
MTDO/IO40 WITH 33OHM SERIES RESISTOR AND 2.2KOHM PULL-UP
MTMS/IO42 WITH 33OHM SERIES RESISTOR AND 2.2KOHM PULL-UP

I2S MICROPHONE (SPH0645LM4H):
BCLK IO4 WITH 33OHM SERIES RESISTOR
WS IO1 WITH 33OHM SERIES RESISTOR
DATA IO8 WITH 33OHM SERIES RESISTOR AND 100KOHM TO GND
SEL GND

AUDIO AMPLIFIER (MAXIM MAX98357AETE+T):
DIN IO21 WITH 33OHM SERIES RESISTOR
BCLK IO4 WITH 33OHM SERIES RESISTOR
LRCLK IO1 WITH 33OHM SERIES RESISTOR
SD_MODE GPA6 WITH 2.2KOHM SERIES RESISTOR
GAIN_SLOT HAS 3-POINT JUMPER TO SELECT BETWEEN VCC AND GND
VDD DECOUPLED WITH 100nF AND 2 x 10uF
OUTP AND OUTN TO SPEAKER CONNECTOR

MEMORY (Winbond W25Q128JVSIQ):
CS SPICS0
CLK SPISCK
DI SPID
DO SPIQ
WP SPIWP
HOLD/RST SPIHD

BATTERY STATUS INPUT (FROM VOLTAGE DIVIDER):
IO9/BAT

USB-C RECEPTACLE:
USB_D-/IO19
USB_D+/IO20
CC1 AND CC2 TO GND WITH 5.1KOHM RESISTORS

GPS MODULE (L76KB-A58):
TXD1 U0RXD/IO44
RXD1 U0TXD/IO43 WITH 330OHMS SERIES RESISTOR
WKUP GPA0
1PPS GPB3
RESET GPA3
SET 0OHM RESITOR TO GND
VBCKP POWERED FROM BATTERY TROUGH AN STLQ015M33R

LoRa MODULE (AI-THINKER RA-01SH-P):
MISO MISOA
MOSI MOSIA
SCK SCKA
NSS IO2 PULLED HIGH WITH 10K
RST GPA4
BUSY IO7
DIO1 IO5 WITH 33OHM SERIES RESISTOR
DIO2 GPB1 WITH 33OHM SERIES RESISTOR
DIO3 GPB0 WITH 33OHM SERIES RESISTOR
RF_EN GPA7

GPIO EXPANDER (MCP23017_ML):
SDA MTMS/IO42
SCK MTDO/IO40
A0 GND
A1 GND
A2 GND
INTA IO10
INTB UNCONNECTED (REQUIRES TO SET INTA AND INTB TO BE MIRRORED IN THE CODE)
RESET SPICLK_P/IO47 PULLED HIGH TO 3V3 WITH 10KOHM
EP GND

THIS GIVES US GPA0-7 AND GPB0-7 IO PINS FROM THE EXPANDER

BUTTONS FOR GENERAL PURPOSE:
GPB2 TO GND UPON PRESSING
GPA5 TO GND UPON PRESSING


UNCONNECTED:
IO3 STRAPPING PIN
SPICS1
IO45 STRAPPING PIN
IO46 STRAPPING PIN


MISOA -> MTDI/IO41
MOSIA -> MTCK/IO39
SCKA -> IO38

MISOB -> IO12
MOSIB -> IO13
SCKB -> IO14


IO0 is pulled high and connected to a FLASH button to ground for flashing.
EN is connected to CHIP_PU, pulled high and connected to a button RESET that can pull it down to GND.
VDDSPI is decoupled to GND trough a 0.1uF, a 1uF and a 10uF capacitors.
XTAL_32_P and XTAL_32_N (GPIO 15-16) are tied to a 32.768kHz crystal.
XTAL_P and XTAL_N are connected to a 40MHz crystal.
GPB7 is connected to an LED.

POWER AND BATTERY MANAGEMENT (BQ25185DLHR):
SYS -> VSYS WITH 10uF DECOUPLING
BAT -> VBAT (BATTERY) WITH 1uF DECOUPLING
STAT2 -> TO 3V3 WITH 10KOHM, TROUGH LED AND 1KOHM TO 3V3 AND TO GPB5
CE -> 10KOHM TO GND
IN -> 5V WITH 1uF AND 2.2uF TO GND
STAT1 -> TO 3V3 WITH 10KOHM, TROUGH LED AND 1KOHM TO 3V3 AND TO GPA1
ISET -> 510OHM TO GND
ILIM/VSET -> 13KOHM TO GND
TS/MR -> 10KOHM TO GND

LOAD SWITCH TPS22917LDBV FROM VSYS (INPUT) TO VSYS_SW (OUTPUT):
VIN -> VSYS
CT -> 1nF TO VIN
ON -> 100KOHM PULLUP TO VSYS AND SWITCH WITH TWO POSITIONS: FLOATING OR TO GND
VOUT -> VSYS_SW
QOD -> 0OHM RESISTOR TO VOUT

VOLTAGE REGULATOR (TLV62569DBV):
VIN -> VSYS_SW WITH 4.7uF DECOUPLING CAPACITOR
EN -> TIED TO VIN
SW -> 4.7uH 3A SERIES INDUCTOR (APH0420T4R7M), THEN 10uF CAPACITOR TO GND, THEN 22uF BULK TO GND, TO 3V3
FB -> CONNECTED IN THE CENTRE OF A VOLTAGE DIVIDER FROM OUTPUT (3V3). 450KOHMS (300K+150K SERIES), THEN 100KOHMS.

